<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 104 0 R
/E (FreshRoute AI is an intelligent freshness management system that helps food distributors monitor, predict, and preserve product quality in real time. By combining IoT microchips and AI analytics, it continuously tracks temperature, humidity, and vibration across delivery fleets. The platform converts this data into dynamic Freshness Scores and actionable insights and even alerting operators before spoilage occurs. Through a unified dashboard, distributors can visualize every truck and batch, make faster routing decisions, and reduce food waste across the supply chain.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [10]
>>
